A small script that generates a new CTF writeup file from a given template, 
so I don't have to manually copy the format each time.

## Usage
python new_writeup.py "Challenge Name" "Path/To/File"

Example:
python new_writeup.py "Hard CTF" "C:/Users/Name/CTF Writeup"

This creates a file with the name "hard-ctf.md" pre-filled the write up format
